@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
state "处理中" as Working
state "待核对放行" as Pending
state "已放行" as Released
state "隔离停用" as Isolated
[*] --> Working : 登记本轮处理\n[设备与包范围已核实]\n/ 保留处理经历
Working --> Pending : 完成处理登记\n[实际处理完成]\n/ 等待监测与核对
Pending --> Released : 确认放行或隔离\n[依据齐全且无未解决异常]\n/ 保留放行责任与时间
Pending --> Isolated : 确认放行或隔离\n[监测异常或未能确认]\n/ 不得正常使用
Released --> Isolated : 标记事后异常\n[后续发现问题]\n/ 停用并追溯相关就诊

@enduml
